# 111 MB — over GitHub's hard 100 MB file limit, so it cannot live in the repo.
# It ships inside the installer instead, and the updater simply never sees it.
# Git LFS is not an option here: raw.githubusercontent.com serves a pointer
# file for LFS objects, and the updater would write that pointer over the model.
